LiteRT Model Zoo Android app

The Text tasks in app/src/main/java/com/google/ai/edge/examples/litert_model_zoo/models/
typed_decisions/ include Kotlin host code from the Android samples of five model repositories in
the litert-community organization on Hugging Face, released under the Apache License 2.0. Each of
those files names its source file and revision in its first lines. The attribution below comes from
the NOTICE files of those samples. The models are not part of this app: it downloads them at run
time, and the About screen links each model's license and component licenses.

Laya multilingual: https://huggingface.co/litert-community/Laya-Multilingual-LiteRT

The host contract and preset schemas follow Laya 0.3.4 by Convai Innovations,
licensed under Apache License 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
