GLiClass-Edge v3.0: https://huggingface.co/litert-community/GLiClass-Edge-v3.0-LiteRT

Model: knowledgator/gliclass-edge-v3.0, revision df03993a2ed98e5e4a0d2dd7efbbd105abe874cf,
licensed under Apache License 2.0. Its encoder is jhu-clsp/ettin-encoder-32m (a ModernBERT
encoder), licensed under the MIT License.

The input builder and the decoder are Kotlin ports of the classification path of the gliclass
package 0.1.20 by Knowledgator (GitHub Knowledgator/GLiClass), licensed under Apache License 2.0:
ZeroShotClassificationPipeline.prepare_input (labels, separator, prompt, text) and
_postprocess_logits (softmax / sigmoid decisions). Changes include Kotlin float32 arithmetic, the
float16 embedding-table upcast, fixed graph windows, and rejection of inputs that do not fit
instead of truncation.

The tokenizer follows the published tokenizer.json contract of Hugging Face tokenizers and
transformers (Apache License 2.0): added-token extraction, NFC, the ByteLevel pre-tokenizer and
byte-level BPE.

Open-Decision DeBERTa-v3-large:
https://huggingface.co/litert-community/Open-Decision-DeBERTa-v3-Large-LiteRT

The graphs and the float16 word table the app loads are converted from a model published by
Kotoba Labs Inc. (Mithril, formerly Kotoba Cloud) under the Apache License 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/com-kotobalabs
Base model: microsoft/deberta-v3-large (MIT License), Microsoft.
The Kotlin tokenizer follows Hugging Face tokenizers' Unigram, Metaspace and Precompiled
normalizer behavior (Apache License 2.0) and the GLiNER2.5-Decide sample's port.

GLiNER2.5-Decide: https://huggingface.co/litert-community/GLiNER2.5-Decide-LiteRT

Model: fastino/GLiNER2.5-Decide, revision 7ee5da4c2415e32259bcdc0b1a7367c32ce8d6f6,
licensed under Apache License 2.0 (model card base_model: fastino/gliner2-large-v1).
Its encoder is DeBERTa-v3-large (microsoft/deberta-v3-large), licensed under the MIT License.

The input builder and the classification decoder are Kotlin ports of the gliner2 2.0.0
classification path from Fastino AI's GLiNER2 project, licensed under Apache License 2.0:
processor.py schema and input formatting, processing/word_splitter.py and the
inference/runtime.py classification post-processing. Changes include Kotlin float32
arithmetic, the float16 embedding-table upcast, fixed graph windows, and rejection of
inputs that gliner2 would decode under another task's settings.

The tokenizer follows the published DeBERTa-v3 tokenizer JSON contract of Hugging Face
tokenizers and transformers (Apache License 2.0).
